<title>PAKISTAN: Port conditions update - Pakistan - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Pakistan - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>KARACHI, Jan 27 - Thirteen vessels waiting off port -- one general cargo for three days, one container vessel for two days, seven fertiliser vessels, the first for 23 days, two loaders, the first for five days, and one oil tanker for one day. Eight vessels laid up off port for their own reasons.</p>
</text>
